[{"client_msg_id":"b6c63352-0565-403b-9434-9b9f0b6c595e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはつぶれちゃったけど「給食当番」も面白かった。","ts":"1627652214.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EA7k3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3da3b59-7c70-40e6-a1ff-49837d5524c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"新御徒町周辺だと「CORE・DO宮崎」がなかなか面白いよ。","ts":"1627652152.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UCL78DG68","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fo6hl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"526d2550-01a3-4c4d-911f-69f0d366e9d0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"佐竹もレンガも限界商店街という印象。\n\n佐竹の真ん中あたりに、タピ屋なんだけど牛スジの食べ物打ってるお店があって気になってる。あとインドカレー屋は入ったことあってまぁ普通。","ts":"1627652045.010300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OYAt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"745c38e4-36f2-4b49-a336-d7258f6cfe55","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"入ったことはない。やなか珈琲店で買っちゃうので。","ts":"1627651960.008800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I08GJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c64d1e6-c161-4413-a4c4-d89e277fe351","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"弊社から近いよ。あるいて…5分かからない。","ts":"1627651910.008100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s4S5J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"541ea240-1b07-4ddd-bfe1-eef24865c970","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ベースキャンプなぁ","ts":"1627651902.007800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eci"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc49b04a-7d97-4e28-9042-ceae7ce4191a","type":"message","user":"UCL78DG68","text":"佐竹商店街だと端っこのコーヒー豆店がずっと気になってたけどついぞ行ってないなぁ…\n\nおなじく、地域密着型ぽくて初回入店のハードルの高さを感じてしまっています\n\u003chttps://tabelog.com/tokyo/A1311/A131101/13110234/\u003e","ts":